      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद कहु बहुरि बखानहु ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108443",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0026",
      "lineIndex": 26,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਕਲ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਪ੍ਰਮਾਨਹੁ ॥੯੨੩॥",
      "transliteration": "sakal tupak ke naam pramaanahu ||923||",
      "translation": "Saying firstly the word “Shat-gaamini”, add the words “Jaachar-nayak-shatru” and know all the names of Tupak.923.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਲੋਗ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਵਿਚਾਰੋ ॥੯੨੩॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सकल तुपक के नाम प्रमानहु ॥९२३॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108444",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0027",
      "lineIndex": 27,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ ਤਰੰਗਨਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sat tara(n)ganan aadh uchaaro ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਸਤ ਤਰੰਗਨਨਿ' (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਕਹੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत तरंगननि आदि उचारो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108445",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0028",
      "lineIndex": 28,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਡਾਰੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh naik padh ddaaro ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि नाइक पद डारो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108446",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0029",
      "lineIndex": 29,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅੰਤਿ ਸਬਦ ਤਾ ਕੇ ਅਰਿ ਕਹੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "a(n)t sabadh taa ke ar kaheeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਦੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਅਰਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अंति सबद ता के अरि कहीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108447",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0030",
      "lineIndex": 30,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਸਭ ਜੀਅ ਲਹੀਐ ॥੯੨੪॥",
      "transliteration": "naam tupak ke sabh jeea laheeaai ||924||",
      "translation": "Saying firstly the word “Shat-tarangni”, add the words “Jaachar-nayak” and the words “ari” at the end, know all the names of Tupak in your mind.924.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝੋ ॥੯੨੪॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नाम तुपक के सभ जीअ लहीऐ ॥९२४॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108448",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0031",
      "lineIndex": 31,
      "gurmukhi": "ਭੂਮਿ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bhoom sabadh ko aadh bakhaano ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਭੂਮਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਨੂੰ ਕਹੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "भूमि सबद को आदि बखानो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108449",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0032",
      "lineIndex": 32,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਪਤਿ ਸਬਦ ਪ੍ਰਮਾਨੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh pat sabadh pramaano ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਪਤਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਨੂੰ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि पति सबद प्रमानो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108450",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0033",
      "lineIndex": 33,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਉਚਾਰਹੁ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko bahur uchaarahu ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਨੂੰ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को बहुरि उचारहु ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108451",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0034",
      "lineIndex": 34,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਸਕਲ ਬੀਚਾਰਹੁ ॥੯੨੫॥",
      "transliteration": "naam tupak ke sakal beechaarahu ||925||",
      "translation": "Saying firstly the word “Bhoomi”, add the words “Jaachar-pati-shatru” and know all the names of Tupak.925.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝੋ ॥੯੨੫॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नाम तुपक के सकल बीचारहु ॥९२५॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108452",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0035",
      "lineIndex": 35,
      "gurmukhi": "ਆਦਿ ਬਿਆਸਨਿਨੀ ਪਦ ਭਾਖੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "aadh biaasaninee padh bhaakho ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਿਆਸਨਿਨੀ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "आदि बिआसनिनी पद भाखो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108453",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0036",
      "lineIndex": 36,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਰਾਖੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh naik padh raakho ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि नाइक पद राखो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108454",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0037",
      "lineIndex": 37,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨਹੁ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko bahur bakhaanahu ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਦਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को बहुरि बखानहु ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108455",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0038",
      "lineIndex": 38,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਕਲ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਛਾਨਹੁ ॥੯੨੬॥",
      "transliteration": "sakal tupak ke naam pachhaanahu ||926||",
      "translation": "Saying firstly the word “Vyasanani”, add the words “Jaachar-nayak-shatru” and know the names of Tupak.926.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝੋ ॥੯੨੬॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सकल तुपक के नाम पछानहु ॥९२६॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108456",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0039",
      "lineIndex": 39,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਿਅਹਨਨੀ ਸਬਦਾਦਿ ਭਣਿਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "biahananee sabadhaadh bhanijai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਿਆਹਨਨੀ' (ਬਿਆਸ ਨਦੀ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बिअहननी सबदादि भणिजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108457",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0040",
      "lineIndex": 40,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਦਿਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh naik padh dhijai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि नाइक पद दिजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108458",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0041",
      "lineIndex": 41,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕਹੁ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਉਚਾਰਹੁ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh kahu bahur uchaarahu ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਨੂੰ ਉਚਾਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद कहु बहुरि उचारहु ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108459",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0042",
      "lineIndex": 42,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਕਲ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਿਚਾਰਹੁ ॥੯੨੭॥",
      "transliteration": "sakal tupak ke naam bichaarahu ||927||",
      "translation": "Saying firstly the words “Vyaahanani” (Vyas), add the words “Jaachar-nayak-shatru” and know all the names of Tupak.927.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਵਿਚਾਰੋ ॥੯੨੭॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सकल तुपक के नाम बिचारहु ॥९२७॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108460",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0043",
      "lineIndex": 43,
      "gurmukhi": "ਪਾਸ ਸਕਤਿਨਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਰੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "paas sakatinan aadh uchareeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਪਾਸ ਸਕਤਿਨਨਿ' (ਆਪਣੀ ਸ਼ਕਤੀ ਨਾਲ ਪਾਸ-ਫਾਹੀ ਨੂੰ ਤੋੜਨ ਵਾਲੀ ਬਿਆਸ ਨਦੀ) (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਉਚਾਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "पास सकतिननि आदि उचरीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108461",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0044",
      "lineIndex": 44,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਧਰੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh naik padh dhareeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि नाइक पद धरीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108462",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0045",
      "lineIndex": 45,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰਿਪੁ ਪਦ ਤਾ ਕੇ ਅੰਤਿ ਭਣਿਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "rip padh taa ke a(n)t bhanijai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਦੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रिपु पद ता के अंति भणिजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108463",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0046",
      "lineIndex": 46,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਕਲ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਕਹਿਜੈ ॥੯੨੮॥",
      "transliteration": "sakal tupak ke naam kahijai ||928||",
      "translation": "Saying firstly the word “Paashsakatanani” (Vipaasha), add the words “Jaachar-nayak-ripu” and know all the names of Tupak.928.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝੋ ॥੯੨੮॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सकल तुपक के नाम कहिजै ॥९२८॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108464",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0047",
      "lineIndex": 47,
      "gurmukhi": "ਪਾਸ ਨਾਸਨਿਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਨੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "paas naasanin aadh bakhaneeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਪਾਸ ਨਾਸਨਿਨਿ' (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਦਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "पास नासनिनि आदि बखनीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108465",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0771_line_0048",
      "lineIndex": 48,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਠਨੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh naik padh Thaneeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਇਕ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 771,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि नाइक पद ठनीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108466",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    }
  ]
